{
  "type": "addon",
  "id": 14,
  "name": "Batteries Not Included - Fika Sync",
  "slug": "batteries-not-included-fika-sync",
  "teaser": "Adds Fika compatibility to Batteries Not Included",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/addons/GnaUtI0KCkaA32c82HyCH1Z0xKrfM5LbHTGRqQzh.png",
  "downloads": 606,
  "description": "<p>This addon is required for proper synchronization between clients in Fika. The server host now has the authority on keeping track of all devices and draining batteries.</p>\n<hr />\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>Applicable to the <strong>server host</strong>, <em>all</em> <strong>clients</strong>, and <strong>headless</strong> <em>if available</em>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2513/batteries-not-included\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Batteries Not Included</a></li>\n<li>Extract the contents of the .zip archive into your SPT-Fika folders</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3N6gTe2.gif\" alt=\"Installation\" />\nThank you <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/27605/drakiaxyz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DrakiaXYZ</a> for the gif</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If you enjoy my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/ozenm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a> ☕</p>\n",
